{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39718","headline":"赠郑明府 · 黄滔","name":"赠郑明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭罗衙吏眼看山，真恐风流是谪仙。\n垂柳五株春娅姹，鸣琴一弄水潺湲。\n援毫断狱登殊考，驻乐题诗得出联。\n莫起陶潜折腰叹，才高位下始称贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}